    "subject": "CMH-232 temporary construction parking lot (AWS Sidney campus): the three Shelby County parcels the 15.2-ac site sits on portions of, south of Campbell Rd and east of N Kuther Rd, City of Sidney, Shelby County OH (FIPS 39149). Parcel numbers as printed in Smart Services' delineation report (Ohio EPA eDoc 4298288 p. 1): 01-1834301.008, .007, .003. Ohio EPA application DSW401262560W.",
