    "caveats": [
      "[verified] Owner of record, deeded acreage, land use, conveyance date/consideration, deed book/page, legal description and tax district are verbatim from the Shelby County Auditor CAMA (SCEO Parcels layer 0, tax year 2025, Extract_ID 6040, read 2026-10-27); null means the service had no value.",
      "Owners: 18-34-301-007 and -008 are NK PARTS INDUSTRIES INC, conveyed together on 2023-10-05 for $6,500,000 at OR2316/4710; 18-34-301-003 is WILCOX INVESTMENTS LLC, conveyed 2024-08-05 for $517,000 at OR2321/356. The USACE parking-lot AJD (4298315) is addressed to NK Parts, but NK Parts does NOT own all three parcels.",
      "This is the set of parcels the parking lot sits on PORTIONS of, NOT a surveyed parking-lot footprint: the three parcels total 40.034 ac deeded / 40.026 ac planar against the 15.2-ac site (13.93 ac disturbed per the NOI on 4298316). No document in the corpus shows the lot's boundary in parcel terms.",
      "No deed, lease, easement or license in the corpus shows the terms on which AWS or its contractors use either owner's land. The deeds (OR2316/4710, OR2321/356) are locators at the Shelby County Recorder, not in the corpus; that question is [open].",
      "acres is the auditor's DEEDED figure; planar_acres is measured from this geometry in UTM 16N (EPSG:32616). Cite the deeded figure for the record and the planar one for area modeling.",
      "The legal descriptions carry the long parcel form '020-18-34-301-00x', the source of the dashed '01-18-34-301-00x' variant printed in the 2026-07-23 ODNR email (4298297 p. 2).",
      "Right-county guard: Shelby County OHIO (FIPS 39149), City of Sidney 45365, Sidney CSD.",
      "Regenerable: WATERMARK_SITE=sidney watermark parcels --parcel 18-34-301-003,18-34-301-007,18-34-301-008 --geojson data/reference/sidney/parking-lot-parcels.geojson, then the enrichment step in data/reference/sidney/README.md."
    ]
